  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes an improved CVaR-based QAOA ansatz for portfolio optimization and evaluates it on simulated 10–16 qubit instances derived from 5 years of Nasdaq stock data. On a 16‑asset instance, the improved CVaR-QAOA reaches the optimal cost in about 35 iterations compared with about 700 iterations for standard QAOA and about 50 iterations for CVaR-QAOA (α=0.01), demonstrating faster convergence in noiseless simulation.",
